Every file below has its source comments removed. The other changes per file:

Copied, code unchanged
  blink_ascii.rs        from blink_ascii.rs
  script.rs             from script.rs

Adapted
  linebreak.rs          from linebreak.rs, line break strictness set to
                        Normal (CSS line-break: auto)
  color.rs              from color.rs, Rgba::rgba constructor removed,
                        parse_hex builds the struct directly
  paint/coverage.rs     from paint/coverage.rs, mask_transformed removed,
                        mask and SUBSAMPLES limited to tests
  paint/encode.rs       from paint/encode.rs, encode_png_best removed
  shape.rs              from shape.rs, plan key reduced to face, direction
                        and script, chws feature on the CJK face, advances
                        from the 26.6 size or the bitmap strike
  text.rs               from the xeet inline layout model, rewritten for CSS
                        spans, white-space, overflow-wrap, inline boxes,
                        per-cluster font fallback and bidi line order
  paint/mod.rs          from paint/mod.rs, display list items reduced to
                        fills, borders, glyph runs and text backgrounds,
                        device size checked against Limits before allocation
  paint/glyph.rs        from paint/glyph.rs, outline y snapped to 1/4 px,
                        quadratics chopped at y extrema and flattened with
                        Skia subdivision counts, embedded Skia mask gamma
                        tables
  paint/shapes.rs       from paint/shapes.rs, squircles removed

Skia

paint/glyph.rs follows Skia's quadratic subdivision (cheap_distance and
diff_to_shift in src/core/SkEdge.cpp), and its embedded mask gamma tables
follow Skia's preblend gamma (src/core/SkMaskGamma.cpp) with contrast 0.2
and gamma 1.2. Skia, https://skia.org, is distributed under this license:

